  - Infer local routine returns with .are and bounded recursive summaries.
  - Check assignments, calls, methods, multis, returns and typed collections.
  - Report fatal diagnostics as native compilation errors at the offending expression.
  - Analyze bounded pure where/subset predicates using propagated constants.
