  - Track native integer storage, lexical aliases and conservative mutation effects.
  - Expand policy, signature, primitive type, dynamic syntax and safety coverage.
  - Check missing methods on exact invocants by default; add :check-methods option.
  - Add bin/static-check.raku for compile-only validation of files or stdin,
